= Integration

Here is the rule of integration.
$
integral x^n d x = 1/(n + 1) x^(n+1)
$

In steps:
+ increase the power by 1
+ divide by the *new* power.

== Examples

- $integral 3x^2 d x = x^3 + c$

- $integral 1/x^2 d x = integral x^(-2) d x = -x^(-1) + c$


